@startuml
title 5. Logout / revocation
autonumber
participant Client
participant Gateway
participant Auth
database Redis

Client -> Gateway : POST /auth/logout (Bearer access)
Gateway -> Auth : forward (validated)
Auth -> Redis : delete refresh token
Auth -> Redis : add access jti to denylist (TTL = remaining life)
Auth --> Client : 204 No Content
note over Gateway,Redis : subsequent requests with that\naccess token fail at step 3 (denylist)
@enduml
